        "2038886": {
          "comments": [
            {
              "attachment_id": null,
              "author": "bfarkas@mozilla.com",
              "bug_id": 2038886,
              "count": 0,
              "creation_time": "2026-05-12T07:26:01Z",
              "creator": "bfarkas@mozilla.com",
              "id": 18078769,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows 10\nFirefox version: Firefox 150.0 / Firefox Nightly 152.0a1 (2026-05-11)\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Access: https://devforum.roblox.com/t/beta-roplus-free-roblox-enhancement-extension/4369102/39\n2. Select any string of text on the page\n3. Right-click the selected text and choose \"Copy Link to Highlight\"\n4. Close the current tab completely (or open a completely new, blank tab)\n5. Paste the copied URL into the address bar and press Enter\n6. Observe the page\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nThe selected text appears highlighted\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nThe selected text does not appear highlighted\n\n**Notes:**\n- If you are already on the loaded webpage, and you paste the text-fragment URL into the address bar and press Enter, the highlighting works correctly. The failure only occurs when loading the URL into a new or entirely refreshed tab.\n- Reproduces regardless of the status of ETP\n- Reproduces in firefox-nightly, and firefox-release\n- Does not reproduce in chrome\n\nCreated from https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/220599",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows 10\nFirefox version: Firefox 150.0 / Firefox Nightly 152.0a1 (2026-05-11)\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Access: https://devforum.roblox.com/t/beta-roplus-free-roblox-enhancement-extension/4369102/39\n2. Select any string of text on the page\n3. Right-click the selected text and choose \"Copy Link to Highlight\"\n4. Close the current tab completely (or open a completely new, blank tab)\n5. Paste the copied URL into the address bar and press Enter\n6. Observe the page\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nThe selected text appears highlighted\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nThe selected text does not appear highlighted\n\n**Notes:**\n- If you are already on the loaded webpage, and you paste the text-fragment URL into the address bar and press Enter, the highlighting works correctly. The failure only occurs when loading the URL into a new or entirely refreshed tab.\n- Reproduces regardless of the status of ETP\n- Reproduces in firefox-nightly, and firefox-release\n- Does not reproduce in chrome\n\nCreated from https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/220599",
              "time": "2026-05-12T07:26:01Z"
            },
